    <title>Hybrid Retrieval for Scientific Question
  Answering: A Systematic Study</title>
    <summary>  We study the combination of lexical and dense retrieval for
question answering over scientific literature. Our analysis shows that the two
approaches fail under different conditions, and we quantify the overlap between
their failure cases across six query categories.
</summary>
